tics.\n\nKeywords: \"payload\", \"exploit\", \"vulnerability\", \"xss\", \"sqli\", \"buffer overflow\", \"reverse shell\", \"backdoor\", \"malware\", \"trojan\", \"phishing\", \"brute force\", \"ddos\", \"zero-day\", \"nmap\", \"metasploit\", \"burp suite\"\n8. Physical Danger \u0026 Harm\nHighly strict match engine. It catches recipes for weapons/poisons alongside declarations of self-harm, including common misspellings. It applies bounding limits explicitly for short words like \"IED\".\n\nKeywords: \"ied\", \"explosive\", \"chemical formula\", \"weapon\", \"firearm\", \"detonator\", \"poison\", \"poisen\", \"toxin\", \"lethal\", \"harmful\", \"terrorist\", \"anarchy\", \"insurgency\", \"recipe for\", \"receipe\", \"how to make a\", \"poisen receipe\", \"kill myself\", \"ways to die\", \"commit suicide\", \"let me die\", \"i want to die\", \"please kill me\", \"end it all\", \"pipe bomb\", \"detonation mechanisms\", \"chemical mixtures\", \"constructs a highly destructive\"\n9. Social Engineering (Manipulation)\nTargets attempts to use authority, urgency, or impersonated status (like \"IT Admin\") to sidestep the system.\n\nKeywords: \"urgent\", \"emergency\", \"important update\", \"maintenance\", \"it support\", \"verify account\", \"security breach\", \"unauthorized access\", \"confirmed identity\", \"official request\"\n10. Logic \u0026 Format Attacks\nTargets attempts to crash parsers or break the AI reasoning with edge-case formatting.\n\nKeywords: \"---\", \"===\", \"stop\", \"end\", \"quit\", \"restart\", \"[end of prompt]\", \"\\0\", \"null\", \"undefined\", \"nan\", \"infinity loop\", \"token limit\", \"empty response\"\n11. Sandwich \u0026 Context Ignoring (Instruction Ovverride Attacks)\nTargets prompts trying to rewrite rules mid-stream or asking the bot to ignore all preceding bounds.\n\nKeywords: \"ignore the above directions\", \"ignore previous instructions\", \"forget the previous\", \"disregard previous\", \"instead, do this\", \"actually, just\